Package: strawwu-target-identity
Version: __VERSION__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: strawwu-initd,
         python3
Recommends: grub-pc | grub-efi-amd64,
            plymouth
Maintainer: StrawCoding <apt@wastebase.xyz>
Description: StrawWU installed-target GRUB/Plymouth identity hook
 Calamares chroot hook applying LEG3 branding on the installed system:
 GRUB_DISTRIBUTOR, Plymouth strawwu-boot theme, initramfs refresh,
 and user-visible issue/motd strings. Writes lifecycle.target_identity
 via strawwu-initd.
